imp/assimp","homepage":"https://www.assimp.org","size":273772,"stargazers_count":12532,"watchers_count":12532,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":3112,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":249,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["3mf","android","asset-pipeline","assets","assimp","c-plus-plus","collada","dae","fbx","fbx-exporter","game-development","gamedev-tool","gamedevelopment","gltf","gltf2","ifc","patreon","python","stl"],"visibility":"public","forks":3112,"open_issues":249,"watchers":12532,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/pulls/4936","html_url":"https://github.com/assimp/assimp/pull/4936","diff_url":"https://github.com/assimp/assimp/pull/4936.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/assimp/assimp/pull/4936.patch","merged_at":"2023-02-04T18:08:12Z"},"body":"When \"getNextBlock\" was called after \"getNextLine\", the pointer could still on the newline.\r\n\r\nThe pointer to a newline could not advance enough, when the line ended with \\r\\n. The resulting buffer was correct, as the buffer range went from <start> until \\r, but that the pointer increased by just 1 could lead to the problem that the next pointer points at \\n, which is still part of the newline and therefore, \"getNextBlock\" got 1 byte too much.\r\n\r\nRefs Issue #4871\r\n\r\nI added a test with a copy of the PLY file inside the test directory. I couldn't figure out a good name. I hope this is ok. A name idea would be appreciated.\r\n\r\nThe comment removed is an outdated comment from me.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/4936/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/4936/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/1446186348","html_url":"https://github.com/assimp/assimp/issues/4871#issuecomment-1446186348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/4871","id":1446186348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAnkjM5WMw1s","user":{"login":"Nosenzor","id":2452388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTIzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2452388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor","html_url":"https://github.com/Nosenzor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nosenzor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-27T11:46:27Z","updated_at":"2023-02-27T11:46:27Z","body":"Excellent news ! Thank for that. Should we close the issue, then ?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/1446186348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Nosenzor","id":2452388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTIzODg=","avatar_url"